# desc: 어떤 거절특허가 수출통제 대상 공정·소자를 구현하는가? — 특허 포트폴리오의 수출통제 노출 (라이선싱·기술이전 심사, IP-R&D 산출물 4)
# suite: pa
# monotone: up
# expect-min: 1
PREFIX ont:  <https://w3id.org/sdkb/ont/>
PREFIX gov:  <https://w3id.org/sdkb/gov/>
PREFIX skos: <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#>
SELECT ?patent ?level ?controlLabel
WHERE {
  ?patent a ont:Patent .
  { ?patent ont:realizesProcess ?concept } UNION { ?patent ont:concernsDevice ?concept }
  ?concept gov:subjectToControl ?control .
  ?control gov:controlLevel ?level .
  OPTIONAL { ?control skos:prefLabel ?controlLabel }
}
ORDER BY ?level ?patent
